   "text": "Ethics. Medical crowdfunding me paisa sirf need se nahi, network aur deserving dikhne se bhi milta hai, aur campaign ausatan target ka lagbhag chalis percent hi jutata hai. Swipe-able bana do to gareebi ka For You page ready.",
